        "text": "<thinking> To create the `safety_client.py` file, I need to write code that provides local configuration and client helper utilities for Text Content Safety. I will use the Amazon Comprehend service for this task, as it offers text content safety features. I will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and set up the client for Amazon Comprehend. </thinking>\n",
