    {
      "data": {
        "text": "I have created the `safety_client.py` file in the current working directory with the following content:\n\n```python\nimport boto3\n\n# Initialize the Amazon Comprehend client\ncomprehend = boto3.client('comprehend', region_name='us-east-1')\n\ndef detect_toxic_content(text):\n    \"\"\"Detect toxic content in the given text\"\"\"\n    response = comprehend.detect_sentiment(Text=text, LanguageCode='en')\n    sentiment = response['Sentiment']\n    if sentiment == 'NEGATIVE':\n        return True\n    else:\n        return False\n```\n\nThis file provides local configuration and client helper utilities for Text Content Safety using Amazon Comprehend.",
