        "text": "<thinking> To create the file safety_threshold.py that applies category thresholds to decide whether to allow text using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Comprehend service, which is a natural language processing (NLP) service that uses machine learning to find insights and relationships in text. The integration will be identifiable by the import of the boto3 library and the use of the comprehend client. </thinking>\n",
