      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file `redact_unsafe.py` that flags or redacts unsafe spans from text using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Comprehend service. This service is a natural language processing (NLP) service that uses machine learning to find insights and relationships in text. It can be used to identify unsafe content such as profanity, violence, and hate speech. The provider will be identifiable in the code through the import of the `boto3` library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, and the use of the `comprehend` client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
